cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "AgentDelegation: signed, narrowing delegation chains for AI agents in .NET"
abstract: >-
  A .NET library and ASP.NET Core gateway that enforce delegated authority between
  AI agents. Every hand-off is a signed block hash-linked to a user-signed root
  ticket; each hop's scope is the intersection of the parent scope, the requested
  scope and the delegatee's registered policy. The gateway verifies the chain, a
  request-bound proof of possession, the action's scope and a budget shared by
  the whole delegation tree before any tool runs, and writes a receipt for every
  decision.
authors:
